WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.980
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.730
That witch who claims the name of a goddess!

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.980
Tie her up! Take the wench and tie her up!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.730
Who gave you permission 
to dye your hair blue?!

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:14.990
Impostor! Impostor! Impostor!

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.990
The Aqua impostor's running away!

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.490
Find the Aqua impostor!

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:22.500
<b>Episode 10   God's Blessing on This Wonderful Party!</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.750
I think the water source is the problem.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.820
That makes sense.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.250
If I can purify that, the hot springs 
should all turn back to normal.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.550
It'll cut off the rotten smell at the source!

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.130
There she is! I found the wannabe!

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.890
Do you really have to save the 
people who are saying all that?!

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:42.180
But they're my darling faithful...

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.900
Come on, I'm an arch priest 
with the Axis Church!

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.730
Here, look at my adventurer card!

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.650
You can't go in, arch priest or not.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.280
One of the overseers just said 
not to let anyone else in.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.780
Overseer?

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.450
Honorable members of the Axis Church...

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.080
It's important that you do this. 
It's the right thing to do.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.070
By letting us through, this town will be—

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.420
Oh, we're in the Eris faith.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.590
Why?!

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.070
Come on, let us through!

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:17.050
The water source up ahead is in danger!

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.680
I just want to save the town!

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.680
<i>Let's see how this plays out.</i>

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.340
No means no, miss.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.000
Go on, head back home.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.390
Wait a minute!

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:26.750
Y'know, you're actually kinda...

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:28.960
pretty attractive, in a way!

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:32.440
Your profile looks like a red 
dragon. It's pretty cool!

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.900
Are you saying I have a lizard face?!

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:40.450
Fine. If you really don't want to let me in,

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:43.760
I'll tell the Axis Church 
that you Eris sect members

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.910
were saying terrible things about our faith.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.660
What the hell is wrong with you?!

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:50.370
It's stuff like this that makes 
Axis cultists a pain to deal with!

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:53.840
And that blue hair—aren't you the one 
who pulled that prank where you

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.500
replaced the hot springs with hot water?!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.840
N-No, all I did was purify the hot springs...

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.270
So it was you!

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.720
We definitely can't let you in!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.220
Now, get out of here!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.220
I figured that's how it'd go.

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:04.260
Hey, wait a minute!

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.040
Come on, Darkness. Here's one of the 
few times you get to be useful.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:07.950
What do you mean, "few"?!

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:10.660
I'm useful on occasion, you know!

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.980
Hey, don't push me! 
What are you trying to do?!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.480
Attention!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.330
Do you realize who this is?!

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:22.870
You're in the presence of a lady of the 
Dustiness family, Dustiness Ford Lalatina!

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:25.790
This is an emergency!

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:29.760
Come on, milady, show that pendant 
you're hiding on your chest for proof!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.510
Hey!

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.590
Milady, stop resisting!

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:34.710
Just cough it up already, milady!

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.550
Kazuma, hold her tight!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.010
I'll get—

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.240
Ow, ow! Darkness, that hurts!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:43.330
Wiz, hurry up and get it! 
Now's your chance to get the pendant!

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:45.610
Wiz! Please, get over here!

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.620
Aqua, keep her right hand steady!

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.230
Come on, milady, calm down!

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.840
Wiz! Hurry it up!

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:51.950
Wiz, go for it!

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:52.700
Milady!

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.290
I'm so sorry, Darkness-san!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.650
I'm so, so sorry!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:03:00.120
Y-You guys, stop this! The Dustiness family 
doesn't just wield its authority for—

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.290
It's the real deal!

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:07.040
We're so sorry for our insolence.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.540
KONOSUBA!

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.550
You're such a pain.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:16.640
Do you want us to treat you as a noble 
or as part of the gang? Figure it out!

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.230
Don't call me a pain!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.300
Aren't you younger than I am, Kazuma?!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:25.800
I treat you this way because I genuinely 
see you as a friend, Darkness.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.580
Yes, not as some older noble 
lady named Lalatina-sama,

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.910
but as our trusty crusader, Darkness.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.440
I-I see...

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.110
In that case, I suppose it's...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.170
So easy.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:39.080
Very easy.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.110
Talk about easy.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.610
G-Guys!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:43.740
There it is.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.790
Whoa, the water's black!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.950
This is poisoned! Like, it's totally poisoned!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:54.160
If this is any indicator, the water source 
has probably been contaminated already.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.170
Let's hurry!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.050
Wait, someone's there.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.260
That's...

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.560
I can't swallow this!

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.230
It'd make me too clean...

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.160
The detergent...

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.890
He looks like he's thinking 
of throwing himself in there.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.420
He was feeling pretty violated 
by the Axis Church.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.150
Wait!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.200
Look out!

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.740
Don't do anything rash!

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:37.130
KONOSUBA!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.530
Well, well! Are you folks sightseers?

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:42.910
Y'know, these hot springs work on lower 
back pain, stiff shoulders, exhaustion,

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:46.410
skin care, not to mention curing the blues, 
negativity, and all sorts of curses!

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:50.660
There are many famous folks from all 
around the world who swear by them!

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.610
So you should—

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.770
I think I've seen him somewhere before...

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.460
Seen me? Why, no! I assure 
you we've never met before.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:01.070
Oh, Hans-san! It's you, isn't it, Hans-san?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:04.350
Wh-Who might that be? 
I'm one of the overseers—

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:08.050
It's been so long, Hans-san! It's me, Wiz!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.750
Wiz the lich!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.580
I'm not sure what you mean...

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.230
If I remember, you're a type of 
Deadly Poison Slime mutant, right?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:19.590
Could it be you were the one 
poisoning the water source?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.130
Slime!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.210
Deadly Slime?

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:26.400
Hey, Hans-san, why are you ignoring me?

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.890
It's me, Wiz! Come on, Hans-san! Hans-san!

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.540
What do you want? I don't know you—

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.460
Please stop shaking me!

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.880
Did you forget about me?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.800
Remember, back at the Devil King's castle—

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.230
Oops!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.820
I just remembered I have 
important business in town—

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.400
Where do you think you're going, Hans?!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.020
Oh, right.

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:48.530
We won't let you pass, Hans!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.260
Oh, okay.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.660
Did you think your excuses 
would actually work, Hans?!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.500
Yeah, fine.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.870
Why don't you stop struggling

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.370
and reveal yourself, Hans?!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.440
Hans!

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:00.610
Damn it!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:03.540
You jerks keep using my name with no respect!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:06.500
Wiz, didn't you say you were 
going to open a store?!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.760
Stop slacking in a hot springs 
town and get to work!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.060
Th-That's so mean!

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.910
I work really hard!

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.600
Even though the harder I work, 
the less money I seem to have...

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.830
I spent ages doing this 
as quietly as possible...

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:25.030
Wiz, isn't the deal that you don't help us, 
apart from maintaining the barrier,

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.110
and in exchange, you don't oppose us?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.950
A kind of non-intervention treaty?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.880
So why are you getting in my way?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:35.620
Wait, am I getting in your way?

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.010
I just wanted to say hi 
because it's been so long!

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.920
And that's getting in my way!

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:45.690
When I think of how I've 
suffered because of you...

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:46.920
You'd better be ready to pay.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:50.430
What now, Wiz? You want to take me on?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.460
These people are my friends!

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:55.060
Can't we discuss this?

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:59.400
You've lost your spine ever 
since you became a lich, Wiz!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:03.200
When you hunted us as an arch wizard,

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.320
you never talked about <i>discussing things</i>!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.510
B-Back then, I couldn't really see 
what was going on around me...

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.070
Wiz, you know him, right?

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:16.240
It's probably hard for you to take 
him on, so you can stay back.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.570
My name is Satou Kazuma!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.500
I have slain countless fearsome foes!

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:27.730
K-Kazuma-san, I would like 
to avoid fighting, but—

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.840
Let's do this, partner.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:31.640
Chunchunmaru.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:32.550
Not!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.730
Very well. All who've learned my 
true identity have bowed down,

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:39.510
begging for mercy...

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.440
You seem to have real backbone.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.860
What're you talking about? You're a 
slime, the weakest of monsters!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:49.140
That deadly poison probably means 
you have some poison attacks,

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.920
but we've got Aqua, who can purify poison!

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.860
I'm not seeing any way we lose!

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.540
My name is Hans...

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.760
I am one of the leaders of the Devil King's army.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:02.050
Hans the Deadly Poison Slime.

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:04.380
What, now? A leader of the Devil King's army?

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:08.520
Hans-san has a high price on his head, 
even among the Devil King's army leaders!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.130
He's incredibly strong, so be careful!

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:13.650
Hey, slimes are weak, right? Total small fry?

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:16.010
Who told you that nonsense?!

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.220
Slimes are fearsome foes!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.650
First of all, physical attacks 
have nearly no effect on them.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.770
You can consider it over 
if they get a hold of you.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.310
Either you'll be melted by their digestive 
enzymes or they'll smother you to death!

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.650
<i>What the heck?! Scary!</i>

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:31.860
Plus, his poison is toxic enough 
to affect every hot spring in town!

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:34.110
Coming in contact means instant death!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.360
I-Instant death?!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.300
Don't worry, Kazuma.

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.990
Even if you die, I'm here!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:44.160
Just don't let him eat you. 
I can't resurrect you if you're digested.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:52.040
Now, face me, courageous adventurers!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:53.340
<b>Emergency Quest</b>

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:53.340
<b>Eliminate Devil King Army Leader
Hans the Deadly Poison Slime!</b>

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.020
And strike me down if you—

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:59.340
Sorry! Really sorry about this!

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:05.270
Hey, why are we running?!

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.340
You idiot! Hurry up and move!

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:10.150
<i>This is bad, bad, bad! 
He's worse than all the others!</i>

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.960
The slime... We're leaving the slime...

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.150
Darkness, seriously, this one would kill you!

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.910
Isn't that...

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:23.410
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.010
Look, let's give up on the water source.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.460
I mean, who'd actually miss the Axis cult?

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.580
What are you saying?!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:34.970
The Axis Church in this 
town is gonna be ruined!

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.470
Isn't that a good thing?

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.680
P-Please stop teasing Aqua-sama!

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:41.560
Fine! Forget it!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:51.420
Are you sure about this? Things are 
just going to get worse, at this rate.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.950
Guess I don't have a choice!

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.200
Hey, you!

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.860
Your element is poison? 
No one's into that! It's too gloomy!

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:11.210
You probably just joined the Devil King's 
army because nobody liked you!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.410
Now, repent!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.210
What?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.040
Aqua!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:15.840
Kazuma!

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:21.950
How do you worms have the 
guts to face me again?

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:27.510
Whatever it is, once I finish with these 
hot springs, I'll be done with this town.

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:28.810
Finally!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:32.560
I'll finally be able to leave 
this disgusting town behind!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.960
Look, I get how you feel...

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.700
Hey, wait! What happened to the real overseer?

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.320
I ate him.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.780
Wait... What did you just...

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.050
I said I ate him!

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:49.040
I'm a slime! My instinct is to consume!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.540
Wiz?!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:54.950
Cursed Crystal Prison!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:01.980
The condition for my neutrality

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:06.430
was that no non-combatants 
were to be killed.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:07.510
Isn't that right?

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:09.850
Wiz! Stop it! Cancel the magic!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:14.360
It's unavoidable that adventurers 
lose their lives in battle.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.590
They take the lives of monsters,

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:20.060
and make their livings doing so.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:23.370
They should be prepared 
to meet a similar end.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.640
The same for knights... They collect taxes,

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.120
and in exchange, they protect the citizenry.

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:31.320
Since they receive that payment,

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.120
Wiz! Do you seriously want to fight me?!

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.950
their involvement in life-and-death 
battles is a natural consequence.

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.130
If we actually do this—

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:35.130
However...

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.710
The entire area around here 
is going to be contamina—

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:42.220
But the nice old man who oversaw these 
hot springs didn't do anything wrong!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.470
Wiz is scaring me...

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.310
To take on the woman who was 
known as the Ice Witch...

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:49.810
I have no other choice!

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:56.460
I'll devour as my instinct commands...

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.990
This is...

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:12.310
What a splendid slime! Such a shame!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:15.170
If it weren't poisonous, I'd take 
it home and make it my pet!

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.220
Did he melt your brain?!

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.220
Get back here! It's dangerous!

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:32.850
What is that?! Is that what 
was polluting the hot springs?!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.560
Purification! Purification! Purification!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.950
Purification! Purification!

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.780
Ah, it burns, it burns!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.090
Forget about that! Just run!

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:45.490
But I can't! If I don't protect 
the hot springs, my faithful...

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:46.470
Look!

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:49.740
The girl with the blue hair 
was telling the truth!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.500
Get him!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.000
Heal! Heal! Heal!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.130
It's burning... It burns so much!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:02.540
Purification! Purification! 
Purification! Purification!

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:05.380
You can do it, lady!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.390
Watch out!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.770
Everyone, get back! It's dangerous!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.270
What're you doing, you stupid Eris cultist?!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.480
You evil cultist!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:23.320
I'll use my explosion magic 
to blow him to smithereens!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:26.320
Don't! It'll pollute the entire mountain!

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.300
Damn it!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.510
Wiz, isn't there anything you can do?!

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:33.330
I can't freeze him at that size 
with my current magic power!

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:35.580
If we could make him smaller somehow...

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:38.260
You polluted our hot springs!

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:41.250
You damnable nincompoop!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.260
I guess even slimes have preferences...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.480
Kazuma!

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:53.990
What's up?

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:57.280
Can't you come up with some sneaky 
plan to deal with this, like usual?!

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:59.020
Don't call it sneaky.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:02.920
Bones?

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.840
That's the hot springs overseer!

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.530
Did that beast eat him?!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.020
It's gonna pay!

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.580
<i>He hasn't been fully digested yet...</i>

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.330
<i>It's our only hope!</i>

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.790
Aqua! You can revive someone if 
they're not fully digested, right?!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.790
Huh? Yeah, I can!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.300
Wiz! You could freeze him 
if he were smaller, right?!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.430
Y-Yes! If he were around half his current size...

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.890
Megumin! You're gonna light 
him up! Get ready to go!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.220
I-I can shoot it?! Okay, I'll shoot it!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:38.940
I need to protect everyone from Hans 
as he's being blown away, right?

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.620
You've got it. I'm counting on you!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.990
<i>A leader-class enemy showing 
up in a hot springs town...</i>

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:49.990
<i>Damn it, what the hell is with 
this world's game balance?!</i>

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:54.120
Purification! Purification! 
Purification! Purification!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.450
I'm gonna be your meal today!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.890
Detonation... Detonation... Detonation...

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:20.130
Wielder of the most glorious, powerful, 
and grand explosion magic...

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:21.600
My name is Megumin.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.340
The blow that I am given to strike

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.920
turns a blind eye to the fate of my kindred,

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:28.250
rendering all hope of rebirth into anguish,

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.650
Purification! Purification!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.160
and the model by which all forces are judged!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.430
Purification!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:35.160
You didn't run out of luck 
when you came to this town!

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:38.910
It was when you picked a fight with us!

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.630
The rest is up to you guys!

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.180
Pitiful creature...

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:58.970
Synchronize yourself with the red smoke, 
and atone in a surge of blood!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.820
Burst forth! Explosion!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.610
Let go of me, you cultist!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:12.900
Get back!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:15.870
Lady?

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:23.130
Cursed Crystal Prison!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:17:02.170
Thank goodness I was able to stop Hans 
before I ran out of magic power...

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:04.840
Is it over?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.690
To think you could push me this far...

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.460
What?!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.720
But it's not over yet.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:23.830
Soon, I will devour you all and be restored!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.700
Defeat the Devil King.

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:32.560
Slay the demons. Defeat the Devil King.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:37.660
Slay the demons. Defeat the Devil King.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:41.950
Slay the demons. Defeat the Devil King!

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:49.850
God Blow!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:00.220
I was wondering what you were up to, 
but this isn't enough to defeat me!

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:03.790
You pathetic priest!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:08.510
Lady!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:11.360
Axis Church, our credo!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.720
"The Axis Church can get things done.

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:17.860
And because you can get things done, 
even if it doesn't go well, it's not your fault!"

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:20.620
"It's society's fault that things don't work out!"

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:24.120
"You can run away from unpleasant things! 
That doesn't mean you've lost!

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:27.120
Because, as they say, 'Sometimes 
running away is winning'!"

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.420
"The answer you come to 
after being in doubt

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.770
is usually something you'll regret, 
no matter what you choose!

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.470
If you're going to regret it anyway,

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:35.760
do whatever's easiest for you in the moment!"

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:38.260
What is this light?!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.620
"Do not fear growing old!

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:44.260
Not even God knows whether you 
will be happy in the future,

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:47.020
so you should, at least, be happy now!"

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:50.400
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:53.930
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:58.660
The sin of corrupting the 
hot springs of my beloved faithful

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.570
has earned you certain doom!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:04.410
Seek God's salvation and repent!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:07.410
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:08.410
It can't be...

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:12.170
Eris pads her chest!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:20.680
God Requiem!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:28.180
The wretched goddess they worship...

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:29.940
It can't be...

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:34.730
It was you?!

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.490
<i>The battle was over.</i>

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:48.940
<i>After the trouble with the 
hot springs, we were shown...</i>

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.020
<i>no gratitude.</i>

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.550
I worked hard to purify them!

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.420
Why's everyone so mad?!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.670
<i>Thanks to Aqua's God Requiem,</i>

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:01.180
<i>all of the hot springs in Arcanretia 
were turned into regular hot water.</i>

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.560
It's just hot water! It's just hot water!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:07.630
<i>The Devil King army's goal of cutting 
off the Axis Church's source of income</i>

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:10.930
<i>ultimately ended up being accomplished.</i>

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:15.060
<i>We were going to head home 
by having Wiz use Teleport...</i>

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.810
<i>But she was struck by the 
power of the purification</i>

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:19.820
<i>and looks like she could 
vanish at any second.</i>

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.320
<i>Come on! Come over here!</i>

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:27.280
<i>So we had to return home 
bouncing along in a wagon again.</i>

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:32.980
That wasn't much of a hot 
springs trip in the end.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:35.040
Hey, look!

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:36.540
Look over there!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.550
I can see Axel!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.810
Hot springs, huh? Must be nice to be you!

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:56.970
Welcome back!

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:59.820
Hey, Kazuma! Let's get some 
drinks at the guild tonight!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:04.250
Welcome home. Sounds like a rough trip.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.540
So you made it back alive.

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:11.400
Maybe you really are...

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:13.320
Nah, I must be imagining things.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.960
Welcome home, everyone!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.590
Now, Megumin, today we'll have our duel!

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:22.270
You were out here waiting 
every day, weren't you?

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:25.470
N-N-No, I wasn't! I just 
happened to come by today!

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:28.220
Oh, very well.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.570
I'll indulge you, since it's been a while.

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:31.780
What? Really?

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:32.560
Yes.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:34.840
We're home!

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:35.600
Welcome back.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.230
Nothing beats being in your own home!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.230
<i>Once winter ends, it'll be spring.</i>

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:46.160
<i>I wake here, sleep here, and live here...</i>

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:46.990
Rock, paper—

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:46.990
<i>in the moment.</i>

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:52.080
<i>To this unfair, impossibly cruel, 
wonderful world...</i>

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.570
<i>God bless it, and you.</i>

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:59.320
Hey, Kazuma-san! The hot water's not working!

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.960
Coming!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Thanks for your support!
</b>~From the Staff & Cast~

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Illustration by Mishima Kurone</b>

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:37.780
Thanks for your support, everyone!

00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:40.240
Our true battle has only just beg—
